@startuml 答题捕获包图
' 孙虹毅 · 第二阶段设计 · 包图
' 表达包的目的、包含的模型与依赖方向；不画具体类细节，类细节见设计类图
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #5B6B7C
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FB
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F3D57
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #B9C7D4
  FontColor #1F2A37
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture.web" as web {
  class CaptureController
  class DevSpawnController
  class CollectionController
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture.service" as service {
  class CaptureService
  class SpawnService
  class CollectionService
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture.repository" as repo {
  interface SpawnRepository
  interface ChallengeRepository
  interface AnswerAttemptRepository
  interface CaptureRecordRepository
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture.port" as port {
  interface QuestionSource
  interface SpeciesCatalog
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture.domain" as domain {
  class Spawn
  class Challenge
  class AnswerAttempt
  class CaptureRecord
  class Question
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture.dto" as dto {
  class "请求与响应 DTO（record）" as Dtos
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture.error" as error {
  enum ApiErrorCode
  class ApiException
}

package "edu.pkmon.demo（旧演示，保留）" as demo {
  class DemoController
  class DemoService
}

web --> service : 调用业务
web --> dto : 出入参
web --> error : 抛出与映射
service --> repo : 读写下层
service --> port : 取题与物种目录
service --> domain : 业务规则
service --> error
repo --> domain : 持久化对象
port --> domain
demo ..> web : 旧路由独立保留，共用统一响应体

note bottom of port
  端口用于隔离外部依赖：
  QuestionSource 取题、SpeciesCatalog 查物种。
  题库未就位时可用测试替身，
  但真实判题不得由替身冒充。
end note

note bottom of repo
  仓储先以接口定义。
  持久化依赖未就位时提供内存实现，
  仅用于单元测试，不冒充真实存储。
end note
@enduml
